## Copyright notices in source files

The crates under the ISC license also carry copyright notices in the headers of their source
files, from more authors than their license files name. These are all of them, as
`tests/release/notice_scan.py` finds them: every `Copyright` line of every file with the ISC
permission notice, in each crate whose license includes ISC. The ISC permission notice that goes
with them is in "License texts" below.

@SOURCE_NOTICES@

